 $\int_{0}^{R}dx\int_{-\sqrt{{R}^{2}-{x}^{2}}}^{\sqrt{{R}^{2}-{x}^{2}}}\cos\left( {x}^{2} + {y}^{2}\right) dy = \int_{0}^{R}d\rho \int_{0}^{2\pi }cos({\rho }^{2})d\varphi = 2\pi \int_{0}^{R}cos({\rho }^{2})d\rho$ 

